  "content.evo_affection.description": "武器飞行速度提高100%；抵达目的地停留1秒后，再飞向武器最近的敌人。",
  "content.evo_affection.name": "喜爱",
  "content.evo_blast_palm.description": "你发射的能量波现在会在命中时产生范围伤害",
  "content.evo_blast_palm.name": "爆裂火球",
  "content.evo_bloodthirst.description": "每次击杀在{SpecializationBehavior.Duration}秒内逐渐恢复{SpecializationBehavior.HealFraction:0%}最大生命，并提高{SpecializationBehavior.CritChance:0%}暴击率；连续击杀刷新暴击持续时间。",
  "content.evo_bloodthirst.name": "嗜血",
  "content.evo_dash_reset.description": "技能1「闪」击杀敌人时冷却缩短 80%",
  "content.evo_dash_reset.name": "闪身步",
  "content.evo_divergence.description": "武技1「波波」命中时给目标叠一层标记；你的「波波」对带标记的目标每层标记提高 {Effects.0.PerStackBonus:0%} 伤害",
  "content.evo_divergence.name": "发散",
  "content.evo_divine_descent.description": "武技3 的范围更大、伤害更高，冷却时间变为 2 秒",
  "content.evo_divine_descent.name": "神降术",
  "content.evo_dragon_arrow.description": "武技1 可以蓄力 3 秒；蓄力 2 秒后射出的箭更大，且附带全穿透。",
  "content.evo_dragon_arrow.name": "龙之箭",
  "content.evo_flow.description": "武技2改为按住每{Effects.0.Tuning.IntervalSeconds:0.#}秒掷出{Effects.0.Tuning.ProjectileCount}把飞刀，伤害为原来的{Effects.0.Tuning.DamageScale:0%}；松开停止。",
  "content.evo_flow.name": "心流",
"content.evo_focus.description": "武技2只掷出一把飞刀，将本次其余飞刀的基础伤害全部合并；蓄力增加的数量也转为这一发的伤害。",
  "content.evo_focus.name": "专一",
  "content.evo_golden_qi.description": "武技1 每次攻击额外发射一道剑气",
  "content.evo_golden_qi.name": "金光术",
  "content.evo_golden_road.description": "武技1只释放下劈，下劈伤害提高50%，向前攻击距离延长",
  "content.evo_golden_road.name": "金光大道",
  "content.evo_great_draw.description": "击杀敌人后，延长当前灵剑持续时间{SkillEnhancement.KillExtensionSeconds:0.##}秒。",
  "content.evo_great_draw.name": "灵能汲取",
  "content.evo_ground_burst.description": "下落攻击落地时把命中的敌人击退",
  "content.evo_ground_burst.name": "地爆",
  "content.evo_light_leap.name": "浮光跃金",
  "content.evo_mercy.description": "武技1 只释放最后一刀，这一刀伤害增加50%",
  "content.evo_mercy.name": "怜悯",
  "content.evo_mindseye.description": "你的箭会给命中的敌人贴上标记；你对被标记的敌人造成的伤害提高 {Effects.0.FlatBonus:0%}",
  "content.evo_mindseye.name": "心眼",
  "content.evo_parry_refresh.description": "技能2「架」格挡成功时刷新冷却",
  "content.evo_parry_refresh.name": "招架反击",
  "content.evo_perfect_focus.description": "武技2 间隔减半，现在发射总会是完美时机",
  "content.evo_perfect_focus.name": "专注",
  "content.evo_philander.description": "武技2后置蓄力时间减半，掷出的飞刀会追踪敌人，优先分配给不同目标",
  "content.evo_philander.name": "花心",
  "content.evo_salvation.description": "武技1 最后一刀击杀敌人时回复生命",
  "content.evo_salvation.name": "普渡",
  "content.evo_spare_dodge.description": "后撤现在可以叠 3 层",
  "content.evo_spare_dodge.name": "有备无患",
  "content.evo_stall_kill.description": "击杀敌人时刷新滞空时间",
  "content.evo_stall_kill.name": "乱金柝",
  "content.evo_thunder_heart.description": "攻击触发闪电链，对最多{SpecializationBehavior.Jumps}个目标各造成{SpecializationBehavior.Damage}伤害，跳跃范围{SpecializationBehavior.Range}米；冷却{SpecializationBehavior.CooldownSeconds:0.#}秒。",
  "content.evo_thunder_heart.name": "雷之心",
  "content.evo_thunder_pool.description": "释放角色技能2时在脚下留下雷池，半径{SpecializationBehavior.Radius}米、持续{SpecializationBehavior.Duration}秒，每{SpecializationBehavior.TickInterval}秒降下{SpecializationBehavior.Damage}伤害的天雷。",
  "content.evo_thunder_pool.name": "雷池",
  "content.evo_thunder_recall.description": "无情再次使用改为瞬移到武器中心并接触收回，立即触发{SpecializationBehavior.LandingDamageScale:0%}倍率的下落落地攻击；飞行速度×{SpecializationBehavior.SpeedScale}，飞行距离×{SpecializationBehavior.DistanceScale}。",
  "content.evo_thunder_recall.name": "落雷术",
  "content.evo_variation.description": "武技1点按快射按1→2→3箭循环，逐箭间隔0.08秒；长按仍可蓄力。连续射击窗口1.2秒。",
  "content.evo_variation.name": "变奏",
  "content.evo_war_afterimage.description": "攻击有{SpecializationBehavior.Chance:0%}概率额外造成一次相同伤害。",
  "content.evo_war_afterimage.name": "战斗残影",
  "content.evo_war_spear.description": "暴击时从身上向附近敌人发射一枚追踪箭，造成{SpecializationBehavior.Damage}伤害。",
  "content.evo_war_spear.name": "战斗之矛",
  "content.evo_wind_domain.description": "浮空时下方地面产生半径{SpecializationBehavior.Radius}米的旋风；接触时每{SpecializationBehavior.HoverExtensionInterval}秒延长浮空{SpecializationBehavior.HoverExtensionSeconds}秒。旋风每{SpecializationBehavior.TickInterval}秒造成{SpecializationBehavior.Damage}伤害，进入旋风的双方投掷物减速75%。",
  "content.evo_wind_domain.name": "风之领域",
  "content.evo_wind_field.description": "周围{SpecializationBehavior.SpawnRange}米内每{SpecializationBehavior.Interval}秒在有效地面生成普通旋风，半径{SpecializationBehavior.Radius}米、持续{SpecializationBehavior.Duration}秒，每{SpecializationBehavior.TickInterval}秒造成{SpecializationBehavior.Damage}伤害。",
  "content.evo_wind_field.name": "风场",
  "content.evo_wind_sword.description": "奔跑时每{SpecializationBehavior.Interval}秒朝周围敌人方向发射一枚旋风弹，造成{SpecializationBehavior.Damage}伤害。",
  "content.evo_wind_sword.name": "风剑",
  "content.evo_wind_trail.description": "奔跑路径上每{SpecializationBehavior.Interval}秒留下半大小旋风（半径{SpecializationBehavior.Radius}米），持续{SpecializationBehavior.Duration}秒，每{SpecializationBehavior.TickInterval}秒造成{SpecializationBehavior.Damage}伤害。",
  "content.evo_wind_trail.name": "风痕",
  "content.mut_blood_armor.description": "已有和之后获得的护甲，每1点转化为{SpecializationBehavior.ArmorHealthRatio}点最大生命值。",
  "content.mut_blood_armor.name": "血铠",
